WEBVTT

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:06.000
SILVER  FANG

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.980
Galactic Shooting Star Silver
SILVER  FANG

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:08.210
GINGA NAGAREBOSHI   GIN
Galactic Shooting Star Silver
SILVER  FANG

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:10.420
SILVER  FANG

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:13.700
Galactic Shooting Star Silver
GINGA NAGAREBOSHI   GIN
SILVER  FANG

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:27.120
Nobody understands us!

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:33.330
We have to do it ourselves!
Silver, we are going to kill Akakabuto!

00:01:50.030 --> 00:01:54.480
<i>The fear that Akakabuto's family,
had awoken from their hibernation -</i>

00:01:54.610 --> 00:01:58.390
<i>made the whole village worried.</i>

00:01:58.580 --> 00:02:03.810
<i>Silver and Daisuke
were most concerned about it.</i>

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:16.460
Silver...!

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:26.510
<i>Silver knew the smell,
which came from the mountain.</i>

00:02:27.020 --> 00:02:31.060
<i>It was not Akakabuto's,
but another animal.</i>

00:02:31.650 --> 00:02:37.020
<i>The scent got Silver restless.</i>

00:02:42.170 --> 00:02:49.230
HOWL! The Mountain Calls

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:58.970
<i>I'm not gonna leave, even if he hits me.</i>

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:03.400
<i>I must borrow
doctors hunting bow.</i>

00:03:13.610 --> 00:03:16.640
Are you going to mountains?

00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:21.480
Doctor!

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:34.390
Why are you going to the mountains?

00:03:35.390 --> 00:03:38.090
We're getting the body
of the bear we killed.

00:03:38.220 --> 00:03:41.840
- I would like to ask one question.
- I won't allow it.

00:03:41.970 --> 00:03:43.640
I didn't even say anything yet!

00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:47.430
I know what you're going to ask.

00:04:05.750 --> 00:04:12.160
You stubborn! I said I'm sorry.
Why don't you lend me the bow?

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:19.160
I'm not giving up.
I'm going to kill Akakabuto!

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:22.250
Damn it!

00:04:31.190 --> 00:04:34.850
Looks like they're serious.

00:05:06.510 --> 00:05:09.840
What's this...?

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:14.510
- Is it the bear we killed?
- Just bones left?

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:21.480
- Hidetoshi, what's the meaning of this?
- It can't be another bear?

00:05:30.870 --> 00:05:33.540
What's wrong, John?

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:41.320
Wild dogs!

00:05:49.140 --> 00:05:52.170
Not regular wild dogs.

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:20.330
Silver!

00:06:20.530 --> 00:06:25.430
Staring at the mountains again?
Come down, I got an idea!

00:06:29.930 --> 00:06:35.840
I'll ask my dad to buy me a bow.

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:42.420
Your dad has gone to the village.

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:48.900
- They're discussing the bear problem.
- The bear problem?

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:59.660
They said at the regions office, that an
8 year old male bear from Miyagi -

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:05.460
named Madara, has come to Akita.

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:10.460
Madara is no human eater.

00:07:10.600 --> 00:07:16.840
But he is so vicious that
he attacks anything he sees.

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:20.140
Madara?

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:23.470
Did you hear that, Silver?

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:32.270
And Mosa, the one-armed bear
from Iwate, is here as well.

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:39.350
He on the other hand attacked and killed
7 woodcutter men in Iwate.

00:08:14.370 --> 00:08:19.490
They're both here in our mountains?

00:08:19.670 --> 00:08:25.240
Yes, and they've been seen in Twin pass.

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:28.140
Twin pass?

00:08:38.810 --> 00:08:40.660
Akakabuto is there!

00:08:41.110 --> 00:08:46.910
The village will be in danger,
if we don't solve this problem.

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:49.910
We need your co-operation.

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:56.920
Our co-operation, How?

00:08:57.170 --> 00:09:00.170
Our weapons can't harm them.

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:04.830
Only Hidetoshi has new model of rifles.

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:08.680
- They're murderers!
- And killed seven!

00:09:10.640 --> 00:09:15.340
- We're also up against Akakabuto.
- We don't stand a chance.

00:09:18.390 --> 00:09:23.090
I'm sorry, but we can't do this.

00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:25.680
Unfortunately.

00:09:28.780 --> 00:09:32.630
Dad! Don't talk rubbish!

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:36.960
Akakabuto sleeps in Twin pass.

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:40.460
If we don't hurry and do anything
now, it will be too late...

00:09:41.210 --> 00:09:43.880
Kid! You are disturbing the meeting!

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:45.820
Stop that!

00:09:51.170 --> 00:09:52.310
Grandpa!

00:09:54.340 --> 00:09:58.030
Daisuke is right.

00:10:04.470 --> 00:10:10.090
We have to hurry, or otherwise
Akakabuto will build a fortress.

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:11.330
Grandpa...

00:10:11.940 --> 00:10:16.330
We cannot crush the fortress,
when it is finished.

00:10:17.740 --> 00:10:21.190
We have to act now!

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:25.050
Grandpa!

00:10:34.380 --> 00:10:38.240
Daisuke! Akakabuto...

00:10:39.220 --> 00:10:42.150
Akakabuto is yours!

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:49.660
Grandpa!

00:10:59.070 --> 00:11:06.910
<i>At the same time in Twin pass,
Madara comes to Akakabuto's territory.</i>

00:12:07.180 --> 00:12:12.600
<i>Akakabuto didn't kill Madara,
but gave him a territory -</i>

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:15.470
<i>as a shield against intruders.</i>

00:12:15.650 --> 00:12:20.480
<i>Akakabuto strengthens the
defense around his fortress.</i>

00:12:38.660 --> 00:12:41.190
Grandpa!

00:12:44.290 --> 00:12:47.490
Grandpa? Are you awake?

00:12:48.210 --> 00:12:50.450
Daisuke...

00:12:50.630 --> 00:12:54.490
Are you feeling okay grandpa?
Silver is here.

00:12:55.380 --> 00:13:00.840
What about bear hunting?
Aren't they after Akakabuto?

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:07.720
- Villagers just talk.
- Damn cowards!

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:12.960
- But I'm going alone!
- Daisuke...

00:13:13.360 --> 00:13:17.520
No grandpa. You need rest.
Silver, come.

00:13:17.700 --> 00:13:19.900
Wait, Daisuke!

00:13:20.740 --> 00:13:24.230
Oh you're here too?

00:13:25.870 --> 00:13:31.740
Don't be angry. I promise to
kill Akakabuto some day.

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:35.290
"Some day" is too late!

00:13:39.430 --> 00:13:46.630
Daisuke is serious.
He's going to mountains.

00:13:46.810 --> 00:13:50.670
Don't worry.
Without hunting bow...

00:13:50.900 --> 00:13:57.230
That's not an obstacle
to Daisuke and Silver...

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:14.530
Let's rest a while.

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:21.000
Okay. I understand.

00:14:28.310 --> 00:14:35.810
- Do you want to buy a hunting bow?
- Yeah, You get this snowmobile in exchange.

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:41.190
But...

00:14:41.820 --> 00:14:43.320
Please mister?

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:47.400
That's not a toy you know.

00:14:52.540 --> 00:14:56.830
- I know that!
- Then, go home kid.

00:14:56.960 --> 00:15:01.460
The adults can barely handle
that huntingbow.

00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:03.040
I can do it!

00:15:07.010 --> 00:15:12.380
Everyone thinks like that first.
But they understand when testing it.

00:15:12.520 --> 00:15:15.640
Let me pull it!

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:21.940
If I pull it,
will you sell it to me, okay?

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:25.820
Quite confident...

00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:30.990
At least you'll understand if you try.

00:15:37.090 --> 00:15:41.080
Don't try too hard now,
so you don't hurt your shoulders

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:42.290
I know.

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:10.400
Don't worry Silver.

00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:20.870
You really know what you're doing!

00:16:25.050 --> 00:16:27.520
Don't worry and watch me.

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:30.420
No, you'll just hurt your shoulder!

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:31.460
Quiet!

00:16:36.520 --> 00:16:39.850
I'll aim at that pine.

00:16:57.000 --> 00:16:58.310
That's right!

00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:02.120
Was it beginner's luck or luck of the draw?

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:04.750
It wasn't luck.

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:07.420
Mister, promise between men, right?

00:17:08.220 --> 00:17:09.250
Thank you!

00:17:10.590 --> 00:17:12.130
Wait!

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:43.830
Silver, look! It's mine!

00:17:45.170 --> 00:17:50.670
It's not a toy.
Exactly the same as the doctor have.

00:17:55.100 --> 00:17:57.010
Feels perfect!

00:18:00.980 --> 00:18:02.220
Look Silver!

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:22.280
We need to do this!
Right Silver?

00:18:37.520 --> 00:18:39.590
We can't wait.

00:18:48.610 --> 00:18:50.060
Silver? What is it?

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:53.820
What?

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:06.330
<i>Silver caught the same mysterious
scent as before.</i>

00:19:09.550 --> 00:19:10.830
Wait, Silver!

00:19:11.970 --> 00:19:13.250
What was that smell?

00:19:13.570 --> 00:19:18.420
Silver has wondered for some
time now ,what that smell was.

00:19:27.650 --> 00:19:28.520
What now?

00:19:36.870 --> 00:19:39.490
A juvenile bear? I see...

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:44.530
The bear tried to take their prey,
so they called for backup.

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:36.370
Unbelievable! Everyone knows their role.
What cooperation!

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:57.440
The dogs killed the bear!
Impressive dogs.

00:20:58.530 --> 00:21:03.360
<i>Now Silver realized
where the smell came from.</i>

00:21:03.740 --> 00:21:08.780
<i>It came from this dangerously,
well organized wild pack of dogs.</i>

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:14.160
Silver! No, it's dangerous!

00:21:26.350 --> 00:21:27.680
Silver! Come back!

00:21:28.180 --> 00:21:29.470
Come back here!

00:21:43.280 --> 00:21:45.400
Silver, come back!

00:22:15.890 --> 00:22:19.810
<i>Silver wondered...
why the howling shook his heart.</i>

00:22:31.370 --> 00:22:36.490
<i>It was the great and charismatic
leader of the pack.</i>

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:40.790
<i>He stared straight at Silver.</i>

00:22:41.580 --> 00:22:45.050
<i>Silver felt the powerful gaze.</i>

00:22:46.220 --> 00:22:51.430
<i>It felt like flames in his eyes.</i>
